sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Phone upload
  participant A as API app.py
  participant S as store/jobs/id
  participant X as Background task
  participant G as Gemini guard
  participant M as Gemini API
  U->>A: POST /captures (meta + photo)
  A->>S: photo, cid.json, OCR rule fields
  A-->>U: 201 in ~2 ms
  A->>X: run_extraction
  alt nameplate
    X->>G: nameplate prompt + photo
  else damage
    X->>G: damage prompt + spoken room, surface
  end
  Note over G: one call at a time, 13 s gap, daily cap
  G->>M: generateContent (JSON schema)
  M-->>G: response
  G->>S: append logs/calls.jsonl
  alt 200
    G-->>X: fields + confidence
    X->>X: nameplate: combine OCR + Gemini
    X->>X: damage: type, size cap 0.5 or 0.8
  else 503
    G->>M: wait 20 s, retry, then fallback model
  else 429, cap hit or error
    G-->>X: raise
    X->>X: keep OCR-only fields
  end
  X->>S: fields, extraction done
  U->>A: POST /notes
  A->>S: note, needs_review
  A->>X: note structuring (same guard)
  Note over U,M: command to fields 2.9 s median, ~13 s per item in an offline burst, ~$0.006 per job
